=========================
BLAS Level 1: rotmg, rotm                                               [TOC]
=========================

*rotmg, rotm* are defined in namespace `flens::blas`.

- *rotmg* computes parameters for a modified Givens rotation.
- *rotm* applies the modified Givens rotation.

*Note:* There is no generic implementation of *rotmg* and *rotm*.  They are
only available if FLENS uses an external CBLAS (e.g. compiled with
`-DWITH_REFBLAS` or `-DWITH_OPENBLAS`); otherwise they abort with an
assertion.  This also applies to the one-sided Jacobi SVD of FLENS-LAPACK
(`lapack::svj`), which uses *rotm*.

